00:30:35.600 --> 00:30:37.260
So yeah, there's
a bunch of them.

00:30:37.260 --> 00:30:40.970
They're really,
really affordable.

00:30:40.970 --> 00:30:42.800
So we'll have a
link-- we'll have,

00:30:42.800 --> 00:30:45.689
