00:30:47.730 --> 00:30:48.940
from the show notes.

00:30:48.940 --> 00:30:51.080
So if you're interested
in this, go check it out.

00:30:51.080 --> 00:30:53.121
But the most important
thing to take into account

00:30:53.121 --> 00:30:55.940
is basically, if you want to
get started, use the free trial.

00:30:55.940 --> 00:30:59.230
And you can always get the
App Engine plus Datastore,

00:30:59.230 --> 00:31:01.340
